   "titulo": "Three genera",
   "texto": [
    "The German has three genera: masculine (**der**), feminine (**die**) and neutral (**das**). They do not match the Spanish and do not follow a clear logic: «the key» is **der Schlüssel** and «the book» is **das Buch**.",
